  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth skills for employment-UNDP-TLS-00124314</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YEES Project aims to tackle two most pressing issues in Timor Leste&#x2019;s youth employment: 1) limited opportunity of being employed and 2) limited opportunity of being entrepreneurs for youth and migrant workers. This project will focus on producing two medium-term sub-outcomes: 1) youth become employed and 2) youth become entrepreneurs, which will contribute to UNSDCF/CPD outcome 2: By 2025, institutions and people throughout Timor-Leste in all their diversity, especially women and youth, benefit</narrative>
  </description>
